**Slot 2 — `task_02.md`: #887, the --restricted shell hop (product)**

--restricted removes bash from the parent and command execution stays one sub_agent hop away — the child is built with its own raw BashTool, independent of the disallow list. The rival's changelog names the real difference: theirs is defined by a class (tools that run commands), mine is a list of one name.

